## 📊 **Documentation Metrics**

### **Quality Indicators**
- **Coverage**: Percentage of public APIs documented
- **Accuracy**: Documentation matches current implementation
- **Completeness**: All required sections present
- **Clarity**: User feedback on documentation usefulness
- **Currency**: Last updated within 30 days of code changes

### **Review Process**
- **Technical Review**: Accuracy and completeness
- **User Review**: Clarity and usability
- **Security Review**: No sensitive information exposed
- **Accessibility Review**: WCAG 2.2 AA compliance

## 🎯 **Documentation Checklist**

### **Before Publishing**
- [ ] All required sections completed
- [ ] Code examples tested and working
- [ ] Links and references verified
- [ ] Grammar and spelling checked
- [ ] Security review completed
- [ ] Accessibility review completed
- [ ] Stakeholder approval obtained

### **After Code Changes**
- [ ] Documentation updated to match changes
- [ ] Examples updated if needed
- [ ] Deprecated features marked
- [ ] Migration guides created if needed
- [ ] Version history updated